									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1367 on:</b> September 02, 2004, 10:23:11 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I don&#039;t know the actual guild names, but the few times I&#039;ve been online earlier in the day, (IE not at work&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" /> ) I&#039;ve seen them raiding in the Elementals, and they seem to be picking up a little steam, but it&#039;s hard to really plot thier progress, but I can&#039;t deny they deserve to be recognized.<br /><br />I&#039;d be more than happy to recognize the name of thier Guilds etc... but it&#039;s a bit confusing exactly what is going on and who&#039;s in it etc...<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
