									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1378 on:</b> September 02, 2004, 05:04:01 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							There is a small difference in the list now, though<br /><br />GoD Content (IE All have killed all of Time):<br />(1) Dol/EiE<br />(2) Ascent<br />(3) Fires of Time<br />(4) Conviction<br /><br />PoP Content: (Still have to Finish Time, IE Kill all through Quarm)<br />(5) Reign of Swords<br />(6) Hegemony<br />(7) Ruination<br />(8) Apothesis <br />(9) Union of Power<br />(10) Asian Alliance (Really have no idea where they are, but they rank somewhere, since they regularly farm rings in earth, and fire mobs)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
